      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `collect_platform_metadata.py` that integrates with a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Bedrock service as the provider. This service is identifiable through the use of the `boto3` library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python. The code will include an example of how to call a model on Amazon Bedrock and collect platform metadata such as usage and model handles. </thinking>\n",
